; STF_BTC_H4_rev04_off.set — PARITY CAGE for rev04.
; Identical to STF_BTC_H4_pyr1.set with the new [08] re-entry lever OFF.
; rev04 run with this set MUST reproduce rev03/pyr1 exactly (M1 MAIN: PF 2.400 / 50 legs / +706).
; A mismatch means the rev04 refactor changed behaviour it was not allowed to change --
; the SuperTrend legStart out-param is harvested from the SAME single pass and must be inert here.
; FULL set on purpose: any input left out is filled from the per-terminal tester cache (ORDER-165).
